  "cited_article_id": "generate-and-submit-claims",
  "reply": "To resolve the V‑402 validation errors, open the Validation Queue (Billing > Claim Center > Validation Queue) after generating your claims. Click each flagged claim (red error icon) to open the editor, correct the highlighted fields, and then click **Save & Re‑validate**. Once the claims clear validation, select them and choose **Batch & Submit**. If the error continues after correcting the data, verify the payer’s electronic format settings under **Billing > Payer Rules**, and review any rejection codes in the Clearinghouse Log under **Reports**."
}
